      "side": 1,
      "message": "Your recent changes are great but I think you missed one of my previous comments advising against using the input structure to `java_...import` in the sdk properties. I\u0027m not surprised as there was also advice against using the same input structure in the `java_...import` as in the `java_...library` so it was confusing.\n\nYour changes fixed the `java_...import` / `java_...library` issue. So, this just covers the `java_...import` / sdk snapshot issue.",
