      "writtenOn": "2023-02-14T11:22:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should be something like this:\n```\nif p.DexPreoptProfileGuided !\u003d nil {\n    dexPreoptSet :\u003d propertySet.AddPropertySet(\"dex_preopt\")\n    dexPreoptSet.AddProperty(\"profile_guided\", proptools.Bool(p.DexPreoptProfileGuided)\n}\n```\nYou could also move the initialization of `dexPreoptSet` outside the `if` as empty property sets are automatically discarded. That would make it easier to add other properties within `dex_preopt` in future. e.g. something like this:\n```\ndexPreoptSet :\u003d propertySet.AddPropertySet(\"dex_preopt\")\nif p.DexPreoptProfileGuided !\u003d nil {\n    dexPreoptSet.AddProperty(\"profile_guided\", proptools.Bool(p.DexPreoptProfileGuided)\n}\nif p.DexPreoptFuture !\u003d nil {\n    dexPreoptSet.AddProperty(\"future\", proptools.String(p.DexPreoptFuture)\n}\n```",
